{"index": 51, "skill": "water-quality", "level": "L3", "question": "查询一段时间内所有水质站的水质变化趋势。", "expected_sql": "SELECT DATE(d.spt) AS '日期', b.stnm AS '测站',\n       AVG(d.dox) AS '平均DO(mg/L)', AVG(d.codmn) AS '平均CODMn(mg/L)',\n       AVG(d.nh3n) AS '平均NH3N(mg/L)', AVG(d.tp) AS '平均TP(mg/L)',\n       AVG(d.ph) AS '平均pH', AVG(d.wtmp) AS '平均水温(℃)'\nFROM sl325.wq_pcp_d d\nJOIN sl323.st_stbprp_b b ON d.stcd = b.stcd\nWHERE b.sttp = 'WQ'\n  AND d.spt >= DATE_SUB(CURDATE(), INTERVAL 30 DAY)\nGROUP BY DATE(d.spt), b.stnm\nORDER BY DATE(d.spt), b.stnm;", "final_answer": "## 水质站水质变化趋势报告（近30天）\n\n**查询时间范围：2026-07-01 ~ 2026-07-31**\n**数据源：sl325.wq_pcp_d，选取数据最完整的10个水质监测站**\n\n### 一、水质指标趋势总览\n\n![水质指标趋势_近30天](/mnt/user-data/outputs/水质指标趋势_近30天.png)\n\n### 二、各站点水质等级分布\n\n![水质等级分布_近30天](/mnt/user-data/outputs/水质等级分布_近30天.png)\n\n### 三、各站点水质概况\n\n| 站点编号 | 站点名称 | 平均水质等级 | CODMn均值(mg/L) | 氨氮均值(mg/L) | 总磷均值(mg/L) |\n|----------|----------|-------------|-----------------|---------------|---------------|\n| HT0021003103000026 | 向阳河水质站(光谱) | Ⅴ类 | ~3.3 | ~0.25 | ~0.36 |\n| HT0021071150000024 | 邗江河水质站(光谱) | Ⅳ类 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 |\n| HT0051002002000016 | 小秦淮河水质站(化学法) | Ⅲ类 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 |\n| HT0051002002000020 | 二道河水质站(化学法) | Ⅳ类 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 |\n| HT0051002004000014 | 沙施河水质站(光谱) | Ⅲ类 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 |\n| HT0051002106000013 | 京杭运河水质站(化学法) | Ⅴ类 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 |\n| HT0051003005000015 | 宝带河水质站(化学法) | Ⅳ类 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 |\n| HT0051003009000011 | 明月湖水质站(化学法) | Ⅲ类 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 |\n| HT0051003052000022 | 瘦西湖水质站(化学法) | Ⅲ类 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 | 数据较少 |\n| HT0051003103000018 | 仪扬河上游水质站(光谱) | **劣Ⅴ类** | ~10.0 | ~1.12 | ~0.11 |\n\n### 四、关键发现\n\n1. **水质最差站点**：仪扬河上游水质站（劣Ⅴ类），CODMn 均值约 10 mg/L，氨氮约 1.12 mg/L，两项指标均超标严重。\n2. **水质较好站点**：小秦淮河、沙施河、明月湖、瘦西湖均为Ⅲ类水质，处于可接受范围。\n3. **溶解氧数据缺失**：所有站点 DO 数据均为 NULL，可能近期未开展该项检测。\n4. **总体趋势**：近30天内各站点水质指标波动较小，CODMn 和氨氮变化幅度不大，水质状况相对稳定。\n\n**评价方法**：单因子评价法（GB 3838-2002），取各指标中最差等级作为站点水质等级。\n**局限性**：溶解氧数据缺失可能影响水质等级评定的完整性；部分站点近30天数据记录较少。", "actual_sqls": ["SELECT COLUMN_NAME, DATA_TYPE, IS_NULLABLE FROM INFORMATION_SCHEMA.COLUMNS WHERE TABLE_SCHEMA = 'sl325' AND TABLE_NAME = 'wq_pcp_d' ORDER BY ORDINAL_POSITION", "SELECT MIN(spt) AS min_spt, MAX(spt) AS max_spt FROM sl325.wq_pcp_d", "SELECT DISTINCT stcd FROM sl325.wq_pcp_d WHERE spt >= DATE_SUB((SELECT MAX(spt) FROM sl325.wq_pcp_d), INTERVAL 30 DAY) AND dox IS NOT NULL OR codmn IS NOT NULL OR nh3n IS NOT NULL OR tp IS NOT NULL LIMIT 50", "SELECT w.stcd, s.stnm, COUNT(DISTINCT DATE(w.spt)) AS data_days, AVG(w.dox) AS avg_dox, AVG(w.codmn) AS avg_codmn, AVG(w.nh3n) AS avg_nh3n, AVG(w.tp) AS avg_tp FROM sl325.wq_pcp_d w LEFT JOIN sl323.st_stbprp_b s ON w.stcd = s.stcd WHERE w.spt >= DATE_SUB((SELECT MAX(spt) FROM sl325.wq_pcp_d), INTERVAL 30 DAY) GROUP BY w.stcd, s.stnm ORDER BY data_days DESC LIMIT 30", "SELECT w.stcd, s.stnm, COUNT(DISTINCT DATE(w.spt)) AS data_days, AVG(w.dox) AS avg_dox, AVG(w.codmn) AS avg_codmn, AVG(w.nh3n) AS avg_nh3n, AVG(w.tp) AS avg_tp FROM sl325.wq_pcp_d w LEFT JOIN sl323.st_stbprp_b s ON w.stcd = s.stcd WHERE w.spt >= DATE_SUB((SELECT MAX(spt) FROM sl325.wq_pcp_d), INTERVAL 180 DAY) GROUP BY w.stcd, s.stnm HAVING data_days >= 3 ORDER BY data_days DESC LIMIT 30", "SELECT stcd, COUNT(DISTINCT DATE(spt)) AS data_days, MIN(spt) AS first_date, MAX(spt) AS last_date FROM sl325.wq_pcp_d GROUP BY stcd HAVING data_days >= 3 ORDER BY data_days DESC LIMIT 30", "SELECT stcd, DATE(spt) AS dt, AVG(dox) AS avg_dox, AVG(codmn) AS avg_codmn, AVG(nh3n) AS avg_nh3n, AVG(tp) AS avg_tp FROM sl325.wq_pcp_d WHERE stcd IN ('HT0051002106000013', 'HT0051003009000011', 'HT0051002002000020', 'HT0051003005000015', 'HT0021071150000024', 'HT0021003103000026', 'HT0051002002000016', 'HT0051002004000014', 'HT0051003052000022', 'HT0051003103000018') AND spt >= DATE_SUB('2026-07-31', INTERVAL 30 DAY) GROUP BY stcd, DATE(spt) ORDER BY stcd, dt", "SELECT stcd, DATE(spt) AS dt, AVG(dox) AS avg_dox, AVG(codmn) AS avg_codmn, AVG(nh3n) AS avg_nh3n, AVG(tp) AS avg_tp \nFROM sl325.wq_pcp_d \nWHERE stcd IN ('HT0051002106000013', 'HT0051003009000011', 'HT0051002002000020', 'HT0051003005000015', 'HT0021071150000024', 'HT0021003103000026', 'HT0051002002000016', 'HT0051002004000014', 'HT0051003052000022', 'HT0051003103000018') \nAND spt >= DATE_SUB('2026-07-31', INTERVAL 30 DAY) \nGROUP BY stcd, DATE(spt) \nORDER BY stcd, dt", "SELECT stcd, DATE(spt) AS dt, AVG(dox) AS avg_dox, AVG(codmn) AS avg_codmn, AVG(nh3n) AS avg_nh3n, AVG(tp) AS avg_tp \nFROM sl325.wq_pcp_d \nWHERE stcd IN ('HT0051002106000013', 'HT0051003009000011', 'HT0051002002000020', 'HT0051003005000015', 'HT0021071150000024', 'HT0021003103000026', 'HT0051002002000016', 'HT0051002004000014', 'HT0051003052000022', 'HT0051003103000018') \nAND spt >= DATE_SUB('2026-07-31', INTERVAL 30 DAY) \nGROUP BY stcd, DATE(spt) \nORDER BY stcd, dt", "SELECT stcd, stnm FROM sl323.st_stbprp_b WHERE stcd IN ('HT0051002106000013', 'HT0051003009000011', 'HT0051002002000020', 'HT0051003005000015', 'HT0021071150000024', 'HT0021003103000026', 'HT0051002002000016', 'HT0051002004000014', 'HT0051003052000022', 'HT0051003103000018')"], "tool_trace": ["read_file", "read_file", "water-db_get_table_schema", "water-db_get_date_range", "water-db_query_water", "water-db_query_water", "water-db_query_water", "water-db_query_water", "water-db_query_water", "water-db_query_water", "water-db_query_water", "write_file", "bash", "read_file", "bash", "bash", "water-db_query_water", "present_files"], "tool_results": ["Table `wq_pcp_d` not found in database `sl323`.", "`wq_pcp_d`: query failed ((1146, \"Table 'sl323.wq_pcp_d' doesn't exist\"))", "[{\"COLUMN_NAME\": \"stcd\", \"DATA_TYPE\": \"char\", \"IS_NULLABLE\": \"NO\"}, {\"COLUMN_NAME\": \"prpnm\", \"DATA_TYPE\": \"char\", \"IS_NULLABLE\": \"YES\"}, {\"COLUMN_NAME\": \"ltnm\", \"DATA_TYPE\": \"char\", \"IS_NULLABLE\": \"YES\"}, {\"COLUMN_NAME\": \"spt\", \"DATA_TYPE\": \"datetime\", \"IS_NULLABLE\": \"NO\"}, {\"COLUMN_NAME\": \"dox\", \"DATA_TYPE\": \"decimal\", \"IS_NULLABLE\